<title>USA: Cairn Energy high bidder on 8 leases.</title>
<headline>Cairn Energy high bidder on 8 leases.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cairn Energy USA Inc said on Friday it was high bidder on eight Gulf of Mexico blocks in a Central Area lease sale, with a 100-percent interest in six of the bids and 30 percent and 20 percent in the remaining two.</p>
<p>If awarded the bids, Cairn's investment in lease bonuses would total $3.7 million, and the company would have increased its investment portfolio to 44 prospects, it said.</p>
<p>Cairn is an oil and natural gas producer focused principally on the Gulf of Mexico's outer continental shelf.</p>
</text>
